/* WiFi 版固件升级：与配网状态页同一种形态，步骤圈 / 标题 / 底部按钮直接复用配网页样式 */
@import "../wifi-provision/wifi-provision.wxss";

.ota-art {
  display: block;
  width: 320rpx;
  height: 240rpx;
  margin: 40rpx auto 0;
}

.wifi-ota-page .provision-title {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0 48rpx;
}

.ota-title-spinner {
  flex: 0 0 32rpx;
  width: 32rpx;
  height: 32rpx;
  margin-right: 16rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  border: 4rpx solid rgba(255, 98, 31, 0.18);
  border-top-color: #ff621f;
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: provisionSpin 0.8s linear infinite;
}

.wifi-ota-page .provision-hint {
  padding: 0 48rpx;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.ota-versions {
  margin-top: 48rpx;
  padding: 0 36rpx;
}

.ota-version-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  height: 96rpx;
}

.ota-version-row + .ota-version-row {
  border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(42, 43, 43, 0.06);
}

.ota-version-row__label {
  color: #33373d;
  font-size: 28rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.ota-version-row__value {
  color: #777e88;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}
